WEBVTT

00:09:01.107 --> 00:09:02.422
technically.

00:09:03.442 --> 00:09:07.306
And we also see it's still possible
to hold other disastrous developments

00:09:07.330 --> 00:09:10.320
we're seeing, such as mass
extinction and soil degradation --

00:09:10.344 --> 00:09:12.403
yes, technically.

00:09:13.668 --> 00:09:18.825
It's just incredibly, incredibly unlikely.

00:09:21.341 --> 00:09:23.800
And in any case,

00:09:23.824 --> 00:09:27.151
the world would have to see changes

00:09:27.175 --> 00:09:29.434
which we have never experienced before.